h4. Community rules

The short version of [[help:community]] and [[help:upload_rules]]:

* Invite-only means you were vouched for. Act like it.
* Do not upload gated or removed material. It will be deleted, and repeated deletions lower your upload limit and can cost you your account.
* Rate correctly. Tag honestly. Do not post duplicates.
* Creators own their private tags; do not try to route around that.
* One account per person. Do not share accounts or make new ones to get around a restriction.

Accounts that break these can be restricted or removed. Questions go to [nodtext]@saber:41chan.net[/nodtext] on Matrix.
